 "system": "adaptintake_v2",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My right shoulder hurts."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me when the shoulder pain first started, how it came on, what you were doing at the time, and whether you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No injury — it just started."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is the shoulder pain for you — for example, if you rated it from 0 to 10, where 0 is no pain and 10 is the worst?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My daughter keeps telling me to get it checked."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me about any medicines you take — regular ones or any started or changed recently — and the dose if you know it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take tablets for my sugar."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much does the shoulder pain get in your way?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Certain movements make it hurt."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you had any operations or hospital stays in the past?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Had a benign breast biopsy, years ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the pain, has anything else been going on with your shoulder?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No weakness, numbness or tingling."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is your shoulder pain today?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My sister had shoulder trouble too."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you see a doctor or nurse regularly for any other health condition?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I see them for my diabetes."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Does the shoulder pain come and go, or is it there all the time?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Not sure — I hadn't really thought about it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Since the shoulder pain started, have you noticed any other changes, like in your appetite, sleep, weight, or energy?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Haven't noticed anything like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What would you most like us to help you with about your shoulder at this visit?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just here for my five-month diabetes and blood pressure check."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How would you describe the feeling in your shoulder?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's a pain, mostly in the right shoulder."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Are your tablets for diabetes only, or for other conditions too?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "One is for my blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Any changes in your breathing, bladder, or bowel habits since the shoulder pain began?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My husband used to say I never sit still."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Did the shoulder pain come on suddenly or slowly, before or after the weekend?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No injury — it just came on."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you had any operations or hospital stays in the past, or none?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just that breast biopsy, back in 2004."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything you’ve noticed that makes the shoulder pain better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Moving my arm the wrong way makes it worse."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Did the shoulder pain start suddenly, or did it come on gradually, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I'm not sure — it just came on."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
